好吃，細軟麵的口感我也很喜歡。\n排隊就聞到炙烤味道，炙燒明太子舒肥雞叉燒一定要吃，舒肥嫩嫩的口感不乾柴。\n老闆會詢問是否需要調整口味，需要改進的部分，蠻用心的！",null,[0,132]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15516913135656932346/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjVTFsVXpOUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15516913135656932346/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjVTFsVXpOUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/15516913135656932346/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjVTFsVXpOUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15516913135656932346/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjVTFsVXpOUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/15516913135656932346/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjVTFsVXpOUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D",[null,null,null,"/local/business/15516913135656932346/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCiRDaGREU1VoTk1HOW5TMFZKUTBGblNVTkxjVTFsVXpOUlJSQUIQAA%3D%3D"]],[null,null,2118,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcU1lUzNRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe47c5eb9c0bb3b50!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICKqMeS3QE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcU1lUzNRRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcU1lUzNRRRItChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNLcU1lU1BREhNDZ3dJX3N2NGdnWVE4TlQ0ckFNGi4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ0txTWVTdlFFEhNDZ3dJX3N2NGdnWVE4TlQ0ckFNIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARUDu7wLlefOQqCzBWTVhNeXBiWGRr\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwir0rfeyNKWAxVGdvUHHZtlOMIQoykIqwEoAw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwji-r3eyNKWAxVMYMIFHb_7LX4Q0pMFCG0oBQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwir0rfeyNKWAxVGdvUHHZtlOMIQ0pMFCKUBKAU"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN5NzR2QllnEAE",["0x0:0xe47c5eb9c0bb3b50",null,1613650262637907,1613651204007304,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115860226410850